r the Evaluation and Management of Chronic Kidney Disease (2024); A Unifying Approach for GFR Estimation: Recommendations of the NKF-ASN Task Force on Reassessing the Inclusion of Race in Diagnosing Kidney Disease (2021); New Creatinine- and Cystatin C-Based Equations to Estimate GFR without Race (2021); KDIGO 2021 Clinical Practice Guideline for the Management of Blood Pressure in Chronic Kidney Disease (2021); Executive summary of the 2017 KDIGO Chronic Kidney Disease-Mineral and Bone Disorder (CKD-MBD) Guideline Update (2017); 2025 AHA/ACC/AANP/AAPA/ABC/ACCP/ACPM/AGS/AMA/ASPC/NMA/PCNA/SGIM Guideline for the Prevention, Detection, Evaluation, and Management of High Blood Pressure in Adults (2025); CMID: Clinical Monitoring Intelligence Database, chronic kidney disease, hypertension, anemia and depression monographs (2026); Adult Immunization Schedule by Age (2026)</paragraph><paragraph>Follow-up: Potassium and creatinine in two weeks. Kidney education session and dietitian session in the next month. Call for dizziness, swelling of the lips or tongue (call 911), or vomiting or diarrhea that stops her eating and drinking (hold losartan that day). Next scheduled visit 1931-02-03: two weeks after starting losartan: potassium, creatinine and blood pressure, and the decision about dapagliflozin. [S]</paragraph></text>

